<title>USA: America West introduces new non-stop service.</title>
<headline>America West introduces new non-stop service.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>America West Airlines said Tuesday it is introducing the only daily non-stop service between Phoenix and Baltimore.</p>
<p>The additional service begins September 25.</p>
<p>The new service will be aboard an Airbus A320, featuring seating for 12 first-class and 138 coach-class passengers.</p>
</text>
